<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 13.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 13.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Dec 13	Dec 12	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  243.870     244.060     237.040    2.88 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.600     304.500     303.640    0.32 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.050     158.060     165.490   -4.50 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.774	46.770	48.410   -3.38 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  403.760     402.760     366.280   10.23 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.895     140.875     147.886   -4.73 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.981	16.990	14.975    6.72 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.840     215.660     230.135   -6.21 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.877	 1.878	 1.939   -3.20 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.564	 1.563	 1.575   -0.70 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  185.915     185.500     206.030   -9.76 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
